WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.083
Open the saved planter in Catalog and choose Edit.

00:03.083 --> 00:04.833
Expand Inventory.

00:04.833 --> 00:07.917
Turn on Track inventory. Keep Each for a planter.

00:07.917 --> 00:12.167
Save Changes to enable stock transactions. The starting count is zero.

00:12.167 --> 00:15.500
Choose Receive when finished planters are ready for sale.

00:15.500 --> 00:20.250
Enter three. Check the projected count, then select Receive three each.

00:20.250 --> 00:25.750
On hand now shows three. Saving product details and recording stock are separate actions.

